---
---
<section class="section-portfolio-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ph-wrapper">
      
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <div class="ph-eyebrow-container">
        <span class="ph-eyebrow">Portofoliu</span>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Split Typographical Layout -->
      <div class="ph-grid">
        <div class="ph-title-col">
          <h1 class="ph-title">Un proiect care arată cum lucrăm.</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="ph-desc-col">
          <div class="ph-divider"></div>
          <p class="ph-lead">
            Prezentăm situația inițială, rolul nostru concret și deciziile care au condus la implementare.
          </p>
          <p class="ph-body">
            Pentru început, prezentăm un proiect pentru care ne asumăm responsabilitatea directă: noua prezență online a Pop Digital Solutions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-portfolio-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 6rem);
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .ph-wrapper {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ph-eyebrow-container {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .ph-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .ph-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ph-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ph-desc-col {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 3rem;
  }
  /* The fine 1px vertical border separating the columns */
  .ph-divider {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    bottom: -20px;
    left: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .ph-lead {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ph-body {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ph-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    .ph-desc-col {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
    .ph-divider {
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>

